<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Invoice Workshop" description="How Invoice Workshop protects document data with browser-only storage and privacy-safe, abstract analytics events." path="/privacy/">
  <article class="simple-page"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Your documents stay on your device.</h1><p class="lead">Invoice Workshop is designed so the business, customer and document information you enter is not sent to our servers in this version.</p><p><strong>Effective date:</strong> August 25, 2026</p><h2>Local document storage</h2><p>Business profiles, logos, customers, catalog items, drafts, completed documents and numbering preferences are stored in your browser using IndexedDB. Lightweight interface preferences may use localStorage. This data remains available only in the browser profile and device where you entered it unless you export and move a backup yourself.</p><h2>PDFs and printing</h2><p>PDF creation and print rendering occur in your browser. Invoice Workshop does not receive the contents of generated documents.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>We may use Google Analytics 4 and Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand site traffic and abstract product actions. Product events are limited to information such as the type of tool used and whether a PDF was downloaded or a document converted. We do not intentionally send names, emails, addresses, tax identifiers, document numbers, invoice amounts, bank details, notes, line items or document contents to analytics services.</p><h2>Technical requests</h2><p>Like most websites, hosting and security providers may process ordinary request information such as IP address, browser details, requested page, timestamps and security signals. Do not put private document data into URLs or query parameters; the application does not use URLs to store document state.</p><h2>Your controls</h2><p>Use “Export backup” to download your workspace or “Clear all local data” to permanently delete Invoice Workshop data from this browser. Clearing browser/site data can also remove it. Keep downloaded PDFs and backups according to your own record-retention needs.</p><h2>Third parties and changes</h2><p>We do not sell document contents. If advertising or other providers are introduced, this policy and the site controls will be updated before those systems receive data. Material changes will be published on this page with a revised effective date.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:privacy@invoiceworkshop.com">privacy@invoiceworkshop.com</a>.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
